& [Reason]
  + active five-hour goal requires dependency-contiguous progress after A4; A5 has reusable verified legacy signature logic but lacks explicit upstream-chain association
  + strict reuse reduces cryptographic duplication; key domains must remain distinct and raw-artifact binding closes substitution seams

& [Limits]
  + legacy signature cannot cover A4 retroactively; future signed witness context is excluded
  + source and formation have no power to mint operator authority trusted time or execution permission

